    models/<org>/<repo>/...           weights, mirroring the Hugging Face repo
    registry.json                     what is pulled, and what is running
    logs/<model>.log                  llama-server output
    docker_catalog.json               cached Docker Hub index, 24h TTL

The layout mirrors Hugging Face exactly, so you can drop files in by hand and
