Environment
  LLAMA_CACHE        move everything above
  HF_TOKEN           for gated repos; otherwise $HF_HOME/token is read
  HF_HOME            where that token is looked up, default ~/.cache/huggingface
  LLCPP_BANDWIDTH    override the memory bandwidth used for estimates, in GB/s
  NO_COLOR           disable colour

Interrupted downloads

  Ctrl-C during a pull keeps what has transferred and records it. `list` shows
