    partial download found: 1.3 GB of 34.6 GB (3.8%), interrupted 2 hours ago
      resume? [Y/r/q]

  y  continue from where it stopped     r  discard and start over
  q  leave it alone and do nothing

  Use --resume or --restart to answer in advance, which scripts and any
