  llcpp serve qwen3.8-27b --no-vision            keep prompt-cache reuse

Exposes an OpenAI-compatible API at /v1 and llama.cpp's web UI at the root.
For wiring this into VS Code or Cursor, see `llcpp help editors`.
""")
    ss.add_argument("model")
    ss.add_argument("--port", type=int, default=None)
    ss.add_argument("--ctx", type=int, default=DEFAULT_CTX)
    ss.add_argument("--no-vision", action="store_true",
